&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="content-grid-card__content-body"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“Whether in our work with candidates, with colleagues, or with clients, how we show up for people defines our success. Will Guidara’s &lt;/em&gt;Unreasonable Hospitality&lt;em&gt; tells the story of Eleven Madison Park’s journey from a casual brasserie to the best restaurant in the world. At its core, it’s a story about people, about extraordinary teams, and about winning (together).”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
