&lt;div aria-hidden="true" class="content-grid-card__content__heading__hidden js-content-grid-card-title-hidden" tabindex="-1"&gt;🎧 Dwarkesh: Michael Nielsen – How science actually progresses&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="content-grid-card__content-body"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“A lot of colleagues at the firm listen to Dwarkesh. This is an older episode, but a fascinating conversation that challenges the linear story we often tell ourselves about how scientific breakthroughs happen. Michael Nielsen offers a thought-provoking look at the role of intuition, verification, and unconventional thinking in pushing the boundaries of what we know.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Michael Sheng&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Options Trader&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="content-grid-card__cta arrow-btn with-text"&gt;
&lt;div class="content-grid-card__cta__text"&gt;
				Learn &lt;span aria-hidden="true"&gt;More&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
