&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“I’m working my way through Reader Bot,  a thoughtful exploration of the tradeoffs that come with AI-assisted learning. The author raises the important question of whether the convenience of outsourcing reading and synthesis ultimately comes at the expense of understanding, curiosity, and independent thought.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
