&lt;div class="content-grid-card__content"&gt;
&lt;h3 class="js-content-grid-card-title"&gt;📖 Against the Gods: The Remarkable Story of Risk&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div aria-hidden="true" class="content-grid-card__content__heading__hidden js-content-grid-card-title-hidden" tabindex="-1"&gt;📖 Against the Gods: The Remarkable Story of Risk&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="content-grid-card__content-body"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Against the Gods&lt;em&gt; is a fascinating history of one of humanity’s greatest intellectual breakthroughs: learning to measure and manage uncertainty instead of simply accepting fate. More than a book about finance or probability, it’s about how better thinking transformed decision-making, and a reminder that understanding risk is one of the most valuable skills you can develop. It’s one I give to every new hire on the desk.” &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
